      "problem": "$$\n[T]_{B|C}=[\\begin{aligned}9 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSuppose $B$ and $C$ are bases of the vector spaces $V$ and $W,$ respectively. The matrix $[T]_{B|C}$ of the linear map $T:V\\to W$ relative to these bases, and the coordinates of the vector $x\\in V$ relative to $B$ are shown above. Find $[T(x)]_{C}.$",
